WHICH DOWNLOAD CONTAINS WHICH

The third-party software listed in this file is bundled into fettle
(Fettler) and into nothing else this repository distributes.

  fettle-<version>-<os>.zip / .tar.gz    CONTAINS PdfPig, listed below
  vscode-shoddy-<version>.vsix           does not
  sparky-<version>-<os>.zip / .tar.gz    does not

Shoddy itself - the mill, the machines, the VS Code extension and sparky -
has no PDF component and no dependency on one, direct or transitive. What
those do contain (Roslyn, Silk.NET, OpenAL Soft, GLFW) is listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which travels inside the extension.

fettle is distributed separately: a release attaches it as its own archive
beside the others. Nothing installs it, bundles it, or requires it, and it
requires none of them.

